    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, including a detailed section on data protection and compliance with regulatory requirements in our bid is essential. a detailed section on data protection and compliance with regulatory requirements in our bid should outline we approach to ensuring the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) compliance, including any relevant certifications or audits we have undergone." ;
