    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the requirements of assisting agents in agents administrative activities (req15), providing intelligent assistance tools (req14), and facilitating access to information (req8), how will our AI solution be designed to integrate with existing practices, ensure continuity of file processing, and provide relevant information while respecting regulatory requirements? our AI solution will be designed as a tool of assistance, integrating with existing practices of the agents, without constituting a rupture in the agents modes of work. our will achieve designed by leveraging our experience in deploying large language models such as Mistral 7B Instruct, which has strong French-language performance and is self-hostable, allowing our to respect regulatory requirements and ensure data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, our will implement retrieval strategies from our RAG capabilities, including dense vector semantic search, BM25 sparse search, and hybrid approaches. implement will enable agents to efficiently search for information in internal procedures and applicable regulation, meeting the requirement of accompanying administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For continuity of file processing, our AI solution will allow sharing of relevant information between agents and services, and provide features for understanding the context of an ongoing file, resuming processing effectively, and proposing actions or steps in administrative processes. our will also ensure that generated contents are adapted to the administrative context and compliant with quality requirements expected. our approach will respect regulatory requirements, including the general regulation on the protection of data, GDPR, and other applicable laws. our will guarantee strict compliance to regulatory requirements, including the general regulation on the protection of data, GDPR, and other applicable laws and ensure that data is protected in an appropriate manner using encryption and anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
