        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A key legal risk to consider is compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), given that we company context specifies expertise in the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) legal instruments. we should ensure that all data protection measures are compliant with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) standards, including appropriate data hosting and transfer mechanisms. we standard contractual clauses include a data protection agreement template version 3.2, which could be useful in addressing these requirements." ;
