        ex:hasText "According to we subcontracting policy, all subcontractors must be EU-established, which inherently requires all subcontractors to adhere to the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and other the EU regulatory standards. we conduct legal and financial due diligence on our subcontractors, including checking for exclusion grounds, which should mitigate some of these risks." ;
